  "prefLabel": "Psyc 304.04 Tele-pass Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Psyc 304.04 Tele-pass Application.\n\n(a) The applicant shall complete and submit the “Universal Application for Initial License” dated March 2023 signed and dated in accordance with Plc 304.05;\n\n(b) In addition to the application in (a) above, the applicant shall provide a list of all names they have ever been known by;\n\nSource. #13862, eff 4-2-24",
